1. Definitions

   "EMAC Anti-Cheat" means the anti-cheat product of EMAC LAB.

   "Integrated Game" means a game that is integrated with EMAC Anti-Cheat, for
   as long as that integration is in effect.

   "Permitted Purpose" means creating, customizing, previewing, validating and
   building launcher packs for an Integrated Game, and distributing those packs
   to the players of that Integrated Game through its launcher.

   "Derivative Repository" means a source repository, public or private, that is
   created from the Template or that contains a copy of any part of the Template,
   modified or not.

   "You" means the person or organization that exercises rights under this
   license.

